# Alembic migrations

This directory contains the migration environment for the PostgreSQL schema used by Dev Interview Notes.

Apply migrations with:

```bash
poetry run alembic upgrade head
```

The Docker Compose `migrations` service runs the same command automatically after PostgreSQL becomes healthy.

Create a migration after changing SQLAlchemy models with:

```bash
poetry run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the schema change"
```

Review autogenerated SQL carefully before committing it. Keep migration revisions ordered and test both upgrade and downgrade behavior when a migration changes existing data.
